					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13735352#post-4776204</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13735352/scp-161-jp#post-4776204</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2020 17:08:09 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Vincent Van Gone</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4874299</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The idea of describing a concept which doesn't actually exist sounds almost impossible, but this article accomplishes that quite elegantly (any translation issues aside). The &quot;hsaut&quot; part feels a bit tacked on though and the article could do without it.</p> <p>Notably, this has the exact same core anomaly as <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3848">SCP-3848</a>. I have no idea which one came first (it was this article by a few years actually), so I'm not saying that this idea was copied from that (or the other way around), but I think that's still worth noting.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
